class.description:
Hears the sounds given to [method AcousticEngine.emit_sound] that reach it: straight through what is in the way, as much as its [AcousticMaterial]s let through, or round through the doorways and corridors of the level's navigation mesh, whichever is louder. Put it where the ears are, on the enemy's body, and react in [signal sound_heard].
[codeblock]
func _on_ears_sound_heard(event, loudness, from_position):
    if loudness > 0.4:
        chase(from_position)
    else:
        investigate(from_position)
[/codeblock]
